{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52068","headline":"四言曲池酺饮座铭 · 陆搢","name":"四言曲池酺饮座铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羣公酺饮，列坐水湄。\n花飘翠盖，叶覆丹帷。\n俱倾圣酒，争摛雅诗。\n下国贱隶，含毫无辞。\n（《翰林学士集》）（按：此诗署「越王文学陆搢」。\n越王即李泰，後徙魏王。\n张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收入本诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆搢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}